.TH "SCCFM-CLI INVENTORY DEVICES CDFMC-MANAGED-FTD DEPLOY" "1" "2026-08-19" "0.39.2" "sccfm-cli inventory devices cdfmc-managed-ftd deploy Manual"
.SH NAME
sccfm-cli\-inventory\-devices\-cdfmc-managed-ftd\-deploy \- Deploy pending configuration changes to...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sccfm-cli inventory devices cdfmc-managed-ftd deploy
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Deploy pending configuration changes to one or more cdFMC-managed FTD devices.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n,\fP \-\-device\-name TEXT
Device name to search for (supports wildcards like 'branch-*').
.TP
\fB\-q,\fP \-\-query TEXT
Filter devices by a Lucene query.
.TP
\fB\-l,\fP \-\-limit INTEGER RANGE
Maximum records to return  [default: 50; 1<=x<=200]
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-offset INTEGER RANGE
Pagination offset  [default: 0; x>=0]
.TP
\fB\-u,\fP \-\-device\-uids TEXT
List of device UIDs to deploy.
.TP
\fB\-\-deployment\-notes\fP TEXT
Notes for the deployment.
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fP TEXT
Human-readable description for the deployment.
.TP
\fB\-\-ignore\-warnings\fP
Ignore warnings from pre-validation and proceed with the deployment.
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fP
Run a preflight check without performing the operation.
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\fP / \-\-no\-wait
Wait for the transaction to finish before returning.  [default: no-wait]
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fP INTEGER RANGE
Maximum seconds to wait for the transaction to complete (used with --wait).  [default: 3600; x>=1]
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fP [table|json]
Output format  [default: table]
.TP
\fB\-\-config\-path\fP PATH
Path to the configuration file (defaults to ~/.sccfm-cli/config.json).
